      {
        "id": 53623,
        "name": "NinjaMonkey",
        "username": "NinjaMonkey",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-22T19:42:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>…&nbsp;The only other downside is it seriously reduces the usefulness of Robot Reclaimation – why pull a bunch of bots back into your hand when you can play them straight from the trash?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm curious to know when is it ever really necessary to use Robot Reclaimation? That card is normally discard fodder for me. Although, now that I think about it, it does synergize pretty well with heroes who allow her to put the top card of her deck into play.</p>",
