        "id": 236302,
        "name": "OddballPaladin",
        "username": "OddballPaladin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-03-23T23:14:06.875Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unity is one of my favorite heroes. I like the minion-maker concept, but too often it gets to micro-management heavy to be fun. Unity is one of only three characters I’ve been able to take a villain down from max to 0 in one turn (Tachyon and Haka are the others), and Unity is able to do it more consistently.</p>\n<p>Personally, I’m fond of pairing Unity and Onmi and just having Onmi use his base power on Unity. Also, Team Leader Tachyon and Legacy are team love.</p>",
